('Continuum: Lifelong Learning in Neurol...', '@ContinuumAAN', 'Jul 29', 'In this issue, Drs. Corey Miller and Christopher Hess discuss the core article on "Thrombolytic, Thrombectomy, and Antithrombotic Therapy for Acute Ischemic Stroke" in the latest issue of @ContinuumAAN. Pods are available on all platforms or at: https://bit.ly/46Y5rTz #NeurologyPodcast', 0, 5, 11, 0, 1300, 'https://bit.ly/46Y5rTz', 'neurointervention OR thrombectomy OR #Neurointervention OR #stroke', datetime('now')),
